ptional ads may collect limited device data through ad partners.\n• You can request data deletion from partners according to their policies.\n\nFor questions, contact support via your app store listing.\n\nBy using this app you agree to this Privacy Policy.</string><string name="menu_help">Help</string><string name="help_content">Welcome to Calculator Launcher.\n\n• Use the Basic tab for everyday calculations.\n• Open the Calculators tab for Tip, Unit, BMI, Mortgage, Loan, Compound Interest, and Currency tools.\n• Each tool uses the on-screen keypad — tap a field, then enter values.\n• Use dropdowns where available to pick options like years, units, or currencies.\n\nNeed more help? Check FAQs from the side menu.</string><string name="drawer_subtitle">All calculators in one place</string><string name="menu_privacy">Privacy Policy</string><string name="faqs_content">Q: Why does my home screen look different?\nA: Some calculator launcher apps can change the default home app. You can switch back from your phone Settings → Apps → Default apps → Home app.\n\nQ: How do I clear a calculation?\nA: Tap C on the keypad, or Reset on Mortgage.\n\nQ: Can I add more currencies?\nA: Yes. Open Currency Converter and tap + Add Currency.\n\nQ: Is BMI medical advice?\nA: No. BMI is for general information only, not medical guidance.\n\nQ: Are exchange rates live?\nA: Rates shown are sample/offline rates for conversion preview.</string><string name="menu_faqs">FAQs</string><string name="rates_failed">Could not refresh rates</string><string name="updated_at">Updated %1$s</string><string name="clear_history_confirm">Delete all calculation history?</string><string name="history_empty">No calculations yet.\nComplete a calculation with = to save history.</string><string name="clear_history">Clear All</string><string name="launcher_set_default_action">Continue</string><string name="launcher_page_apps">Apps</string><string name="launcher_page_home">Home</string><string name="launcher_set_default_message">Make Calculator Launcher your default home screen to use it like a phone launcher.\n\nTap Continue and choose Calculator Launcher when prompted.</string><string name="launcher_set_default_title">Set as home app</string><string name="launcher_set_default_later">Not now</string><string name="launcher_swipe_hint">Swipe left for all apps</string><string name="launcher_apps_empty">No apps found</string><string name="launcher_swipe_hint_back">Swipe right for calculator</string><string name="onboarding_intro_title">Calculate Anything</string><string name="onboarding_got_it">Got it!</string><string name="onboarding_default_bubble">default home app for one-swipe access to your calculator.</string><string name="onboarding_default_home_label">Default Home App</string><string name="onboarding_loading">Loading</string><string name="onboarding_tool_calculator">Calculator</string><string name="onboarding_system_launcher">System launcher</string><string name="onboarding_terms">Terms</string><string name="onboarding_continue">Continue →</string><string name="onboarding_revert_bubble">can change back anytime from the Help section.</string><string name="onboarding_revert_home">Revert Home Screen</string><string name="home_weather_placeholder">29° Cloudy</string><string name="customize_add_home">Add to Home screen</string><string name="customize_search_hint">Search Apps</string><string name="revert_keep_home">Keep Calculator Home Screen.</string><string name="settings_terms">Terms of Service</string><string name="settings_wallpaper">Wallpaper</string><string name="terms_content">Terms of Service\n\nBy using Calculator Launcher you agree to use the app for personal productivity. Features may change. Launcher mode is optional and can be reverted anytime from About → Revert Home Screen.</string><string name="customize_calc_settings">Calculator Settings</string><string name="customize_title">Pick the apps you want on your home screen</string><string name="customize_select_all"